Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  NN-19 Digital Sampler
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (no drum pads on NN-19)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter & LFO               (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> amp envelope               (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	NN19 Digital Sampler
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"NN-19"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// NN-19 has no drum pads; the lines below are ready-to-enable templates.
//Map	Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 2		Select Next Patch
//Map	Pad 3		Filter On/Off
//Map	Pad 4		Sample Start

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter & LFO ---
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter Res
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter Env Amount
Map	Knob 4 A		LFO Rate

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): amp envelope ---------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Env Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Amp Env Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		Amp Env Sustain
Map	Knob 4 B		Amp Env Release

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel
